// Names of System.Contnrs in Delphi that Puy does not provide; using one is E3022
// (docs/spec/stdlib/System.Contnrs/README.md, which has the same table). One per line: the
// name, `:`, and what to use instead (the note of E3022 is `use … instead`).
TList: `TList<T>` or `TObjectList`
TStack: `TStack<T>` or `TObjectStack`
TQueue: `TQueue<T>` or `TObjectQueue`
TComponentList: `TObjectList`
TCustomBucketList: `TDictionary<K, V>`
TBucketList: `TDictionary<K, V>`
TObjectBucketList: `TDictionary<K, V>`
